><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">나.&nbsp;응모기간&nbsp;:&nbsp;2014.&nbsp;4.&nbsp;1.&nbsp;~&nbsp;4.&nbsp;30.(30일간)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">다.&nbsp;대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;상&nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;전&nbsp;국민&nbsp;누구나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">라.&nbsp;입선발표&nbsp;:&nbsp;2014.&nbsp;5.&nbsp;26.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">마.&nbsp;문의전화&nbsp;:&nbsp;강진군&nbsp;친환경농업과&nbsp;식품유통팀&nbsp;UCC담당자&nbsp;061)430-3132</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-f